## Execution Rules

### Docker services — WAJIB via docker exec
Semua command untuk Dockerized services HARUS dijalankan via:
```
docker exec -it [container_name] [command]
```

### Host services — jalan di host langsung
Hanya service di tabel "Host Services" yang boleh jalan di host.
Agent HARUS log setiap host execution ke hook-log.txt.

### DILARANG
- Bare `npm install` di host (kecuali service ada di Host Services)
- Bare `composer install` di host
- Bare `pip install` di host
- Hardcode port di file manapun — selalu baca dari .env
